"xavfsizlik nuqtai nazaridan, brauzeringiz uchinchi tomonlar tomonidan "
"egallab olinmaganiga ishonch hosil qilish uchun zarur."

#: .\venv\Lib\site-packages\django\views\csrf.py:41
msgid ""
"If you have configured your browser to disable “Referer” headers, please "
"re-enable them, at least for this site, or for HTTPS connections, or for "
"“same-origin” requests."
msgstr ""
"Agar brauzeringizda «Referer» sarlavhalarini o'chirib qo'ygan bo'lsangiz,"
" iltimos, ularni hech bo'lmaganda ushbu sayt uchun, HTTPS ulanishlar "
"uchun yoki «same-origin» so'rovlar uchun qayta yoqing."

#: .\venv\Lib\site-packages\django\views\csrf.py:46
msgid ""
"If you are using the <meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"> tag"
" or including the “Referrer-Policy: no-referrer” header, please remove "
"them. The CSRF protection requires the “Referer” header to do strict "
"referer checking. If you’re concerned about privacy, use alternatives "
"like <a rel=\"noreferrer\" …> for links to third-party sites."
msgstr ""
"Agar <meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"> tegidan "
"foydalansangiz yoki «Referrer-Policy: no-referrer» sarlavhasini qo'shgan "
"bo'lsangiz, iltimos, ularni olib tashlang. CSRF himoyasi qat'iy "
"tekshirish uchun «Referer» sarlavhasini talab qiladi. Maxfiylik haqida "
"xavotirda bo'lsangiz, uchinchi tomon saytlariga havolalar uchun <a "
"rel=\"noreferrer\" …> kabi muqobillardan foydalaning."

#: .\venv\Lib\site-packages\django\views\csrf.py:55
msgid ""
"You are seeing this message because this site requires a CSRF cookie when"
" submitting forms. This cookie is required for security reasons, to "
"ensure that your browser is not being hijacked by third parties."
msgstr ""
"Siz bu xabarni ko'ryapsiz, chunki bu sayt formalarni yuborishda CSRF "
"cookie faylini talab qiladi. Bu cookie xavfsizlik nuqtai nazaridan, "
"brauzeringiz uchinchi tomonlar tomonidan egallab olinmaganiga ishonch "
"hosil qilish uchun zarur."

#: .\venv\Lib\site-packages\django\views\csrf.py:61
msgid ""
"If you have configured your browser to disable cookies, please re-enable "
"them, at least for this site, or for “same-origin” requests."
msgstr ""
"Agar brauzeringizda cookie fayllarni o'chirib qo'ygan bo'lsangiz, "
"iltimos, ularni hech bo'lmaganda ushbu sayt uchun yoki «same-origin» "
"so'rovlar uchun qayta yoqing."

#: .\venv\Lib\site-packages\django\views\csrf.py:67
